# papers/text/*.md are transcriptions of the PDFs, written LF-only, and
# scripts/check_transcriptions.py reads them back to validate page coverage and
# LaTeX delimiters. Keep the working-tree copy LF whatever core.autocrlf says:
# these files carry glyphs that line-ending conversion has silently eaten before.
# Nothing else here is pinned.
papers/text/*.md text eol=lf
